<tbody><tr>
<td id="fileinfotpl&#95;desc" class="fileinfo-paramfield" lang="en">Description<span class="summary fn" style="display:none">Oak trees, Dorp Street, Stellenbosch.jpg</span></td>
<td class="description">
<div class="description en" dir="ltr" lang="en"><span class="language en" title="English"><b>English&#58; </b></span> Oak trees, Dorp Street and The Avenue, Stellenbosch
Dorp Street is the old wagon road to Cape Town and, just like three centuries ago, visitors still enter the town along the same road. Thus the old street rightly serves as an introduction to the Town of Oaks</div><table cellspacing="0" style="width:550px; text-align:center; color:#000; background:#ddd; border:1px solid #bbb; margin:1px;" dir="ltr" lang="en" class="layouttemplate">
