<td style="font-size:8pt; padding:1pt; line-height:1.1em;">This media shows a South African Protected Site with <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/South_African_Heritage_Resources_Agency" class="extiw" title="en:South African Heritage Resources Agency">SAHRA</a> file reference <a class="external text" href="https://heritage.toolforge.org/api/api.php?action=search&amp;format=html&amp;srcountry=za&amp;srid=9%2F2%2F084%2F0001-026">9/2/084/0001-026</a>.</td>
